          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Look at the figure carefully. Observe that PB is a transversal to the parallel lines PQ and BD. Therefore, "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\angle  QPB"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
