              "content": "\\angle \\mathrm { P B D }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " are alternate angles, and so are equal. "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\mathrm{So} \\angle \\mathrm{PBD} = 30^{\\circ}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " . Similarly, "
